		timeOffReportTotalScheduled: "Scheduled",
		timeOffReportAbsenceRate: "Absence rate",
		timeOffReportTotalBalanceHelp: "**What it is:** Leave still available at the **end of the selected period**.\n\n**How it’s counted:** Accrued balance minus **approved** leave in that period — including approved days later in the range. For “This year”, that’s **year-end remaining**, not “as of today”.\n\n**Not included:** Pending requests. Unlimited policies.",
		timeOffReportTotalTakenHelp: "**What it is:** Approved leave that already falls in the selected period.\n\n**How it’s counted:** Only **approved** days that sit **on or before today** and inside the date range. Multi-day requests count only the days that overlap the period.\n\n**Not included:** Pending or rejected requests. Future approved days (those show under Scheduled).",
		timeOffReportTotalScheduledHelp: "**What it is:** Leave still ahead in the selected period.\n\n**How it’s counted:** **Pending** requests in the range, plus **approved** days **after today** that still fall inside the period.\n\n**Not included:** Approved days on or before today (those are Taken). Rejected requests.",
		timeOffReportAbsenceRateHelp: "**What it is:** Share of the team’s weekday capacity used as approved leave.\n\n**Formula:** **Taken days** ÷ (**weekdays in period** × **members**)\n\n• **Taken days** — same as Taken in period (approved, in range, on or before today)\n• **Weekdays** — Mon–Fri in the selected period\n• **Members** — everyone the report covers, including people who took no leave and so have no row. Filtering by member or balance narrows it to those people.\n\n**Not adjusted for:** Public holidays or part-time hours.",
